[{"id":3332997276,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7GqYCc","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"Feel free to list me as a co-author if you wanna lift changes wholesale from #111608; I have no strong preferences towards which PR ultimately fixes the issue","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111498#pullrequestreview-3332997276","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111498","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-10-13T20:51:24Z"},{"id":3333017079,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Gqc33","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?u=24618295fece29a0bf5c850faf2555985232f5f2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","login":"aaronfranke","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111498#pullrequestreview-3333017079","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111498","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-13T20:53:53Z"},{"id":3333265484,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7GrZhM","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","login":"Mickeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111498#pullrequestreview-3333265484","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111498","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-13T22:43:57Z"},{"id":3335116489,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7GydbJ","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","login":"dsnopek","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek"},"body":"> I updated this PR with these changes:\r\n> \r\n> * Serialize NaN as `null` instead of `\"NaN\"`.\r\n> * Print a warning when encoding NaN similar to PR [Core: Enforce strict JSON for non-finite numbers, document native workaround #111608](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111608) (not the same message, and not for Infinity)\r\n> * Add a warning to the documentation similar to PR [Core: Enforce strict JSON for non-finite numbers, document native workaround #111608](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111608) (not the same docs, but similar, thanks @Repiteo).\r\n\r\nOk, so with these changes, I think this is now satisfying the requirements (as I remember them) that were set out at the core team meeting:\r\n\r\n1. We match the behavior of another big project. I don't know how \"big\" graphite-web is, but serializing `NaN` as `null` also matches the behavior of `JSON.stringify()` in web browsers (if I open Chrome's devtools and type `JSON.stringify({\"a\": NaN\"})` into the console it outputs `'{\"a\":null}'`) which is certainly a big enough target :-)\r\n2. We print a warning, so developers have a clue to follow if they get unexpected results from a web service or whatever application they are giving the JSON to\r\n\r\nSo, I approve! However, since this was reverted, it should probably get a few more approvals before going forward","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111498#pullrequestreview-3335116489","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111498","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-10-14T11:29:40Z"},{"id":3336158882,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7G2b6i","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"I stand by my initial approval; even moreso with the added documentation and using `null` instead of `\"NaN\"`. It does still need core consensus before going anywhere, so we'll be sure to discuss the refactored implementation at tomorrow's core meeting","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111498#pullrequestreview-3336158882","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111498","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-10-14T15:02:16Z"},{"id":3394968747,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7KWxyr","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"Discussed in the Godot core meeting.\nThis implementation matches the criteria we set at a previous Godot meeting:\n\n- It does not produce invalid JSON\n- It matches an existing implementation\n\nThis problem cannot be perfectly solved, but after our meeting we're convinced that this implementation will create the least problems.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111498#pullrequestreview-3394968747","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111498","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-29T17:40:01Z"},{"id":3395069072,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7KXKSQ","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","login":"Mickeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111498#pullrequestreview-3395069072","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111498","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-29T18:01:48Z"},{"id":3395102559,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7KXSdf","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:0